*.log

# Never bake JWT signing keys into an image layer. They are gitignored, so they
# are absent from a fresh clone, but `lexik:jwt:generate-keypair` creates them
# locally and a build from such a working copy would copy the private key in.
# In production they are mounted from outside the image and must persist across
# releases, otherwise every issued token is invalidated on each deploy.
config/jwt/
